-- ---- assertions ----


-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): earned income relief
#ASSERT (`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras heng household` 1 10000)'s `earned income relief` EQUALS 1000
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): qualifying child relief (child reliefs)
#ASSERT (`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras heng household` 1 10000)'s `child reliefs` EQUALS 4000
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): total reliefs
#ASSERT (`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras heng household` 1 10000)'s `total allowed` EQUALS 15000
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): chargeable income
#ASSERT `the chargeable income from assessable income` 49750 `less reliefs` ((`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras heng household` 1 10000)'s `total allowed`) EQUALS 34750
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): tax on the first 30,000
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2026 `on chargeable income of` 30000 EQUALS JUST 200
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): tax on the next 4,750 at 3.5%
#ASSERT ((`the tax by bands` `Table 3` `on` 34750)) MINUS ((`the tax by bands` `Table 3` `on` 30000)) EQUALS 166.25
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): gross tax on chargeable 34,750
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2026 `on chargeable income of` 34750 EQUALS JUST 366.25
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): parenthood rebate for the first child
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `first child of the family` `, event on` (YearMonthDay 2025 6 30) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 5000
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): rebate offset against tax of 366.25
#ASSERT 5000 MINUS ((`a rebate of` 5000 `against tax of` 366.25)'s `rebate carried forward`) EQUALS 366.25
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): net tax payable
#ASSERT ((`a rebate of` 5000 `against tax of` 366.25))'s `tax after rebate` EQUALS 0
-- iras-sample-heng (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): net tax payable, household end to end
#ASSERT `the income tax in` (`the position of an adult` `iras heng household` 1 `iras heng adult` 10000) EQUALS 0

-- iras-sample-fong (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): earned income relief
#ASSERT (`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras fong household` 1 7650)'s `earned income relief` EQUALS 8000
-- iras-sample-fong (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): total reliefs, CPF relief taken as IRAS 7,650
#ASSERT (`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras fong household` 1 7650)'s `total allowed` EQUALS 15650
-- iras-sample-fong (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): chargeable income
#ASSERT `the chargeable income from assessable income` 249750 `less reliefs` ((`the relief breakdown given CPF` `iras fong household` 1 7650)'s `total allowed`) EQUALS 234100
-- iras-sample-fong (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): tax on the first 200,000
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2026 `on chargeable income of` 200000 EQUALS JUST 21150
