-- iras-sample-fong (IRAS page sample-calcs, YA 2026): NOT ASSERTED. The page gives an employee CPF relief of 7,650 for a man aged 64 in 2025 on 250,000 of
-- earned income. This encoding gives 11,730 for the age band above 60 to 65 all year, and 7,650 only for one aged 65 or over all year (7.5% of 102,000).
-- The page states no birth month and no pay layout, so the figure cannot be derived from it; FINDINGS.md section 4 records it as an open disagreement.
-- The rest of the example, with the CPF relief taken as the page gives it (the assertions above), agrees: relief, chargeable income and tax.

